        "## Comments\n",
        "\n",
        "</br>\n",
        "\n",
        "Sometimes we write things in the coding window that we want Python to ignore. These are called comments and start with `#`.\n",
        "\n",
        "</br>\n",
        "\n",
        "Python will ignore the comments and just execute the code."
