    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "sum([1, 100])"
      ],
      "id": "55f867db",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "::: {style=\"font-size: 90%;\"}\n",
        "it will tell you the answer, 101.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ". . .\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {style=\"font-size: 90%;\"}\n",
        "But if you write\n",
        ":::"
