      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Operations\n",
        "\n",
        "</br>\n",
        "\n",
        "We can do simple operations with vectors. For example, we can sum all the elements of a list."
      ],
      "id": "50b91764"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| echo: true\n",
        "\n",
        "my_list = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n",
        "sum(my_list)"
