        ":::\n",
        ":::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Importing pandas\n",
        "\n",
        "Fortunately, the **pandas** library is already pre-installed in Google Colab.\n",
        "\n",
        "</br>\n",
        "\n",
        "However, we need to inform Google Colab that we want to use **pandas** and its functions using the following command:"
